# Agent handoff notes and local working folders — local only.
#
# HANDOFF.md names the real experiment folders, external drive paths and the
# researcher's own work; it was published here by mistake and must not return.
# AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md are instructions to the agents, not part of the product.
# `non-sharable/` is the holding area for anything else in that category, and
# `sharable/` is tracked but kept empty of anything personal.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
non-sharable/
